            <div class="field string-long ema-event__field-ema-summary">  <p>The European Medicines Agency (EMA) and its partners in the European Medicines Regulatory Network (EMRN) plays a key role in advancing women’s health. This event highlights the contribution of the EMRN partners and brings together perspectives from patients, healthcare professionals, academia, industry, and global partners.</p>


